      "value": "@{60c0e22718009c104862d5bc|full_name}: I do have proof of the issue. When using mobile internet you could be switching between towers. Route changes with in the connection cause the time out and I have charts to prove that. however the game client should still have a exception handler in there for that knowing how common it is. VRChat is not the only platform to have this issue. Discord, Minecraft, and even business platforms have this issue as well.",
